# 2026-06-04 Legacy FreeSWITCH docs replaced by the new Users Manual.
# Page and section redirects now live in legacy-redirects.map, which nginx checks first.
# These rules are the last resort for legacy URLs that map does not know about.
# Literal keys above are matched before these regex rules, so existing redirects win.
# Two forms per section: the leading-slash form (the one that actually matches
# $request_uri) plus a no-leading-slash companion. (/|$) catches both the section
# index ("/freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-Explained") and any descendant page; no end-anchor
# so old "?pageId=..." query strings are covered too.
~*^/freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-Explained(/|$)        /freeswitch/;
~*^freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-Explained(/|$)         /freeswitch/;
~*^/freeswitch/Channel-Variables-Catalog(/|$)   /freeswitch/;
~*^freeswitch/Channel-Variables-Catalog(/|$)    /freeswitch/;

# 2026-06-04 The Community/Office Hours page is retired with the legacy docs;
# Office Hours info now lives on the external signup linked from the banner.
# Trailing-slash and leading-slash companions, same as the rules above.
/freeswitch/community/office-hours/ /freeswitch/;
/freeswitch/community/office-hours  /freeswitch/;
freeswitch/community/office-hours/  /freeswitch/;
freeswitch/community/office-hours   /freeswitch/;